2b:["$","details","What if the Wi-Fi is down in the morning?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["What if the Wi-Fi is down in the morning?",["$","svg",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"icon ","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 5v14M5 12h14"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You'll still see the day as it was last saved. Finishing a task, approving one, and claiming a reward need a connection, and Apparent doesn't queue changes for later. The hold runs on your child's device and keeps its schedule offline. If the app can't tell where things stand, it leaves the hold as it was, so held apps stay held until the device reconnects."}]]}]
